  "comments": "<p><i><strong><u>BU 1999 - 2001</u></strong></i><br>Set introduction of the euro with coins from 1999 to 2001<br><i><a href=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/63936acc26541.jpg\"><img src=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/63936acc26541.jpg\" alt=\"\"></a></i><br><br><i><strong><u>BU 2002</u></strong></i><br>1 - Coffret annuel - les éperons d'or 100,000 copies + 1 medal (700 years of the battle of the golden spurs: 1302 - 2002)<br><a href=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/5f7b5544c8ffc.jpg\"><img src=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/5f7b5544c8ffc.jpg\" alt=\"\"></a><br>2 - Farewell to the franc, welcome to the euro, 20,000 copies<br><a href=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/5f7b5552d0539.jpg\"><img src=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/5f7b5552d0539.jpg\" alt=\"\"></a><br>3 - Road cycling CM, 20,000 copies<br><i>image to be found</i><br><br><i><strong><u>BU 2003</u></strong></i><br>1 - 50 years of TV in Belgium + 1 medal (50 years of TV in Belgium), 100,000 copies<br><a href=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/5f7b515bcda37.jpg\"><img src=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/5f7b515bcda37.jpg\" alt=\"\"></a><br>2- 100 years of Ford, 15,000 copies<br><i>image to be found</i><br>3 - Birth, 10,000 copies<br><i>image to be found</i><br>4 - Wedding 10,000 copies<br><i>image to be found</i><br><br><i><strong><u>BU 2004</u></strong></i><br>1 - 140 years of the Red Cross 60,000 copies + 1 classic medal<br><a href=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/5f7b5dba80e18.jpg\"><img src=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/5f7b5dba80e18.jpg\" alt=\"\"></a><br>2 - 140 years of the Red Cross + 1 medal with the cross painted red, 2,000 items<br><i>image to be found</i><br>3 - Birth, 10,000 copies<br><i>image to be found</i><br>4 - Wedding 10,000 copies<br><i>image to be found</i><br><br><i><strong><u>BU 2005</u></strong></i><br>1 - Grand' Place + 1 medal uncolored 38 000 copies<br><a href=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/5f7b609c5a7fa.jpg\"><img src=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/5f7b609c5a7fa.jpg\" alt=\"\"></a><br>2 - Grand' Place + 1 medal colorized, 2,000 copies<br><i>image to be found</i><br><br><i><strong><u>BU 2006</u></strong></i><br>1 - Flemish Beguinages + 1 medal uncolored 38 000 copies<br><a href=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/5f7b61958ae38.jpg\"><img src=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/5f7b61958ae38.jpg\" alt=\"\"></a><br>2 - Flemish Beguinages + 1 medal colorized at 2,000 copies<br><i>image to be found</i></p>",
